fixture zone1_11_control_plain_throw
doc Control for BUILD.md s5 tech 11: a plain throw. The ember is thrown straight ahead from the near ledge (a throw flies 400 u: 40 f at 10 u/f) and teleported to once it has stopped; the air jump and the air dash then carry the body on. No dash-jump, no throw mid-dash: it falls into the pit well short of the far face (2880 u).
room zone1/11_ember_toss_cancel
frames 200
input
  0..5 R
  6..11 R jump
  12..38 R
  # The throw from the near ledge, facing the chasm.
  39 toss
  # The teleport once the ember has stopped (out on the throw's frame 4, 40 f of flight), then the
  # air jump and the air dash.
  90 toss
  96..110 R jump
  112 R dash
  113..199 R
end
expect
  at 39 event.toss=1 state=ground
  at 83 ember=1
  at 90 event.teleport=1 ember=0 state=air
  mark fell 91..199 event.hazard=1
  at fell x<1500u
  never 0..199 x>2880u
end
